 "sources": {
  "ace_song": "Sources: ACE-Step 1.5 Hugging Face card, huggingface.co/ACE-Step/Ace-Step1.5, and GitHub README, github.com/ace-step/ACE-Step-1.5 (MIT; turbo DiT + Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B + VAE + optional 5 Hz lyrics LM; 10 s to 10 min; 50+ languages; training data licensed / royalty-free / synthetic MIDI; caveat: unintentional similarity to existing styles), read through a research agent, Oct 12 2026. Line budget, tempo defaults and structure: p0pc0rn music probe v002 (Oct 12 2026, the 5 Hz LM 0.6B planner on: lines heard 21 to 35 of 40; back-to-back identical choruses scored worse). Marker and end-on-chorus rules: the song-lane measurements (Sep 23 2026), rewritten. No-coffee rule: Josh, Oct 8 2026.",
  "faq": "Sources: p0pc0rn's model-download design (Oct 12 2026: the video model's Gemma 2 text encoder is gated, so each person logs in once); the Gemma Terms of Use shipped in licenses/GEMMA_TERMS_OF_USE.txt; the video pack notice (licenses/NOTICE-video.md: SANA-Video reads prompts with Gemma-2-2B-it); the Bigger brain: NVIDIA's model card for NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-E4B-BF16 (text in, text out; OpenMDW-1.1) and p0pc0rn 3.8's design (Oct 24 2026: chat and pictures on Juli's own model; writing and making planned and written by the Bigger brain).",
  "foley": "Sources: MMAudio GitHub README, github.com/hkchengrex/MMAudio (code MIT; checkpoints CC BY-NC 4.0; video-to-audio; trained length 8 s; limits: speech-like mumbling, weak background music, unfamiliar concepts), and the Hugging Face card hkchengrex/MMAudio (licence tag cc-by-nc-4.0), read through a research agent, Oct 12 2026. Image-encoder licence: the p0pc0rn audio probe notes (Apple DFN5B CLIP, research only).",
  "klein4b": "Sources: FLUX.2 [klein] 4B model card, huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B (Apache-2.0; 3.876 B parameters; text-to-image and editing; card caveats on text rendering and prompt style), read through a research agent, Oct 12 2026. Phone timings and the 4-bit text finding: p0pc0rn engine measurements (iPhone 16 Pro Max, Oct 11 2026). Skin, text-on-screens and prompt-bleed rules: lessons from the picture lane, rewritten.",
  "musicvideo": "Sources: Josh's standing rules: the vertical hook in the first 15 seconds (Oct 5 2026), b-roll carries the arc (Oct 6 2026), visual variety and a strict arc (Oct 4-5 2026), no coffee cliche (Oct 8 2026), \"the clip ends with\" (Sep 23 2026), never compute times in the model (lip-sync cookbook); rewritten for a phone with no lip-sync. Clip timing: p0pc0rn estimate (about 6 minutes per 5-second 832x480 clip).",
  "safety": "Sources: p0pc0rn's copyright, trademark and likeness lesson and use policy (rights.js and USE-POLICY.md, from Josh's \"Copyright & IP Policy Research: AI Media Generation App\", Oct 12 2026: 17 U.S.C. §§ 106, 107, 1202; the TAKE IT DOWN Act; state right-of-publicity laws; the studio suits against Midjourney). General information as of Oct 12, 2026, not legal advice.",
  "sana_video": "Sources: SANA-Video 2.0 5B 720p 4-step model card, huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/SANA-Video_2.0_5B_720p_4step (Apache-2.0; text-to-video only; 81 frames at 16 fps; Gemma-2-2B-it text encoder with a detailed-description instruction; card caveats on motion, anatomy, text, object permanence and long prompts), read through a research agent and the pack's card copy, Oct 12 2026. Phone timing: p0pc0rn estimate. SANA-Video 2.0 5B 720p base card (huggingface.co/Efficient-Large-Model/SANA-Video_2.0_5B_720p: text-image-to-video; \"image-conditioned generation can drift from fine details in the source image\"). Ending-frame and camera-word rules: adapted from an LTX camera cookbook and \"the clip ends with\" rule; picture-start and two-picture rules: adapted from a first/last-frame lane and identity notes (never move back from a face). None measured on SANA-Video yet."
 },
